2. PAGE ENGINE
--------------
Not in this repository. `anvil-dom`, `anvil-style`, `anvil-layout`,
`anvil-paint`, `anvil-raster`, and `anvil-script` are `anvil-engine`.
That repository is proprietary. This file does not license it.

Revisions of those crates that were already published in this repository
under the Apache License 2.0 stay under that license for those revisions
only.

3. COMPANION LIBRARIES
----------------------
Not in this repository. `anvil-cipher`, `anvil-compress`, `anvil-image`,
`anvil-json`, `anvil-ttf`, `anvil-gpu`, and `anvil-video` are separate
repositories under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The text is in
`LICENSE-MPL`, and also at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

They are not vendored here. Under MPL-2.0 section 3.3, a larger work may
link those libraries beside the proprietary files in this repository and
beside `anvil-engine`.

